@startuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title SSD: Withdraw Money Using Visa Card\n(Main Success Scenario)

actor ":Customer" as Customer
participant ":ATM_System" as System

== Card Insertion ==
Customer -> System : 1: insertCard(cardData)
activate System
System --> Customer : 2: display("Enter PIN")
deactivate System

== PIN Entry ==
Customer -> System : 3: enterPIN(pin)
activate System
System --> Customer : 4: display(accountMenu)
deactivate System

== Withdrawal Selection ==
Customer -> System : 5: selectWithdrawal()
activate System
System --> Customer : 6: display(amountOptions)
deactivate System

== Amount Entry & Validation ==
Customer -> System : 7: enterAmount(amount)
activate System
System --> Customer : 8: display("Dispensing cash...")
System --> Customer : 9: dispenseCash(amount)

== Card Ejection ==
System --> Customer : 10: ejectCard()
System --> Customer : 11: display("Take your card and cash")
deactivate System

== Session End ==
Customer -> System : 12: takeCardAndCash()

@enduml